 "remarks": "Welcome to The Mill offering a sophisticated, effortless approach to Westport living, pairing a distinctive setting with thoughtful amenities and the convenience of a condominium. Designed for those who appreciate style, The Mill combines modern architecture with an exceptional trove of luxuries and well-appointed spaces. This delightful, sun-lit unit provides luxurious features complementing the residence's refined aesthetic. New high-end appliances, large center island and ample storage in both kitchen and bedrooms include 2 walk-in closets in the primary suite. Residents enjoy a resort-like outdoor setting with pool, lounge area and grilling stations-perfect for a quiet afternoon or entertaining. The rooftop terrace adds an inviting place to gather. Inside, an elegant resident lounge and generous coffee station provides a comfortable setting for the daily ritual. A dedicated on-site concierge adds an additional level of service and convenience. The Mill provides a beautifully designed setting close to Westport's restaurants, shops, arts, culture and all transportation.",
